  clueLetter: 
  clueText: '"March 16th, 2019"

    "Today I turned 18 today. To be honest, I almost
    forgot today was my birthday, until Eden reminded me. She always teases me for
    being so forgetful that my username for anything is always just my name. I guess
    she''s a bit right... We used to be really close, but even though we still talk,
    I feel that we are drifting away. She seems to... resent me lately. But! I plan
    o-.."

    ... The diary entry ends there.'
